    <node id="sym:repo2graph/answer.py::_ollama_base">
      <data key="d0">sym:repo2graph/answer.py::_ollama_base</data>
      <data key="d1">symbol</data>
      <data key="d2">_ollama_base</data>
      <data key="d11">_ollama_base</data>
      <data key="d12">function</data>
      <data key="d3">repo2graph/answer.py</data>
      <data key="d5">python</data>
      <data key="d13">161</data>
      <data key="d14">175</data>
      <data key="d15">def _ollama_base(value: str) -&gt; str:</data>
      <data key="d16">Normalise OLLAMA_HOST to an http(s) base URL.

    `ollama serve` documents (and exports) the schemeless `127.0.0.1:11434`,
    which urlopen rejects with `unknown url type: 127.0.0.1`. Default the
    scheme to http and refuse anything that is not http(s), so a stray
    `file://` value cannot turn into an urlopen target.</data>
      <data key="d4">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry x="3898.12" y="279.95" width="117.50" height="30.55" />
          <y:Fill color="#57C7E3" transparent="false" />
          <y:BorderStyle color="#4a4f57" type="line" width="1.0" />
          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" fontSize="11" textColor="#1c2330" visible="true">_ollama_base</y:NodeLabel>
          <y:Shape type="ellipse" />
        </y:ShapeNode>
      </data>
    </node>
