      <data key="d15">def _http_error(spec: dict, exc) -&gt; str:</data>
      <data key="d16">A one-line explanation of a provider HTTP error, without its URL.

    HTTPError.url can carry credentials for some providers, so it is never
    echoed; the status and the provider's own message are enough to act on.</data>
