      <data key="d5">python</data>
      <data key="d13">252</data>
      <data key="d14">274</data>
      <data key="d15">def _empty_answer(spec: dict, raw_tail: list) -&gt; str:</data>
      <data key="d16">Why a 200 response carried no answer text.

    Ollama answers HTTP 200 with {"error": "model 'x' not found"}; without this
    the command would print nothing and exit 0, which reads as a valid empty
    answer.</data>
