      <data key="d15">def sanitize_value(key: str, value: Any) -&gt; Any:</data>
      <data key="d16">Redact one parameter value, recursing into containers.

    Args:
        key: The field name this value arrived under; matched against
            SECRET_KEY_RE so a credential in an obviously-named field is caught
            even when its shape is unremarkable.
        value: Any JSON-compatible value.

    Returns:
        The value with anything secret-looking replaced, and long strings cut.</data>
