      <data key="d15">def b64url_decode(text: str) -&gt; bytes:</data>
      <data key="d16">Decode base64url without padding, as every JWT field is encoded.

    Args:
        text: The base64url segment.

    Returns:
        The decoded bytes.

    Raises:
        AuthError: If the segment is not valid base64url.</data>
