      <data key="d5">python</data>
      <data key="d13">484</data>
      <data key="d14">509</data>
      <data key="d15">def client_metadata_document(base_url: str, name: str = "repo2graph") -&gt; dict[str, Any]:</data>
      <data key="d16">A Client ID Metadata Document, as RFC 7591 client metadata.

    CIMD serves this at a URL and uses that URL as the `client_id`, so the
    document must be reachable at the id it advertises.

    Args:
        base_url: The externally reachable base URL of this server.
        name: Human-readable client name.

    Returns:
        The metadata document.</data>
