      <data key="d15">def _auth_env(token: str | None) -&gt; dict:</data>
      <data key="d16">Environment carrying the clone credential out of band.

    The token must never be an argv element (ISS-16): it would be visible in
    `ps`/`/proc` to every other user. git reads http.extraheader from
    GIT_CONFIG_* for this one invocation only, so nothing lands on disk either.</data>
