      <data key="d14">198</data>
      <data key="d15">class StubEmbedder:</data>
      <data key="d16">Deterministic, dependency-free stand-in for a sentence-transformer.

    `model_id` is what `repo2graph.embed.model_id_of()` must report for this
    object (the attribute is the contract the mismatch guard is tested
    through); `dim` is the width of every returned vector; `calls` records one
    entry per `encode()` call, holding the exact list of texts it was given.</data>
      <data key="d4">
        <y:ShapeNode>
