      <data key="d15">class FakeStream:</data>
      <data key="d16">A stream that reports an encoding and handler but accepts anything.

    Deliberately does *not* enforce its own declared encoding on write: these
    tests are about what `encodable` decides to hand over, not about
    re-implementing TextIOWrapper.</data>
