      <data key="d15">def test_verify_rag_never_defaults_the_model_to_the_index_claim(embedded_index, monkeypatch):</data>
      <data key="d16">The guard must compare against the *configured* model, not the index's.

    Defaulting the query-side model id to `vector_meta["model_id"]` makes
    fuse_ok compare a value with itself: permanently true, and the guard is
    gone. This asserts the default that reaches `default_embedder` is the
    built-in one, never the index's claim.</data>
