      <data key="d15">def test_the_settle_loop_is_incremental_not_a_blocking_while(tmp_path):</data>
      <data key="d16">Layout must yield to the browser between batches.

    A synchronous `while (alpha &gt; ...) step()` blocks the main thread for the
